WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:04,830
They say they let that kid practice on the outside for a few months.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:06,230
I was lucky enough to step on Inoyama.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:08,830
Do you really regard luck as your strength?

4
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:13,710
I need to get this kid back

5
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,710
The field staff shouted through loudspeakers

6
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,710
Now everyone knows about it

7
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,710
You rush into the mountain and drag him back

8
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:23,440
Why did he raise his head after he came back empty-handed?

9
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,440
You can't help even if you're in the mountains with your legs and feet.

10
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,140
you are right

11
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,140
Huzi must have inherited your cracking talent

12
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,140
I've only been into the mountains a few times now

13
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,140
wild boar robe wild mountain body

14
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,140
When have you ever come back empty-handed?

15
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,140
How dare he do this

16
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,140
I must be aware of it

17
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:38,470
Genetic shit

18
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,470
He needs to be as good as me

19
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,570
I don’t need to be worried

20
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:43,570
Come back this time

21
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,570
I have to deal with him well

22
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:48,510
What are you doing

23
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:49,640
You can't enter the mountains

24
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:53,530
Not going into the mountains

25
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,530
I went to the field department to contact Huzi through Infinite Palace.

26
00:00:55,530 --> 00:01:08,910
Give him a few warnings

27
00:01:08,910 --> 00:01:11,520
A thousand yuan real bear paw

28
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,520
black shrimp roe

29
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:20,570
Don’t worry, your uncle is here.

30
00:01:20,570 --> 00:01:22,570
I'm not a black-hearted boss

31
00:01:22,570 --> 00:01:43,870
You are all my partners, good

32
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:50,600
Stay safe today

33
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,950
You changed your connection too quickly

34
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:53,950
From Hare God of War to Losing Dog

35
00:01:53,950 --> 00:02:04,050
Only 0.3 seconds

36
00:02:04,050 --> 00:02:05,050
As the saying goes

37
00:02:05,050 --> 00:02:07,050
Wild old wolves don't mess with dogs

38
00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:08,050
But run now

39
00:02:08,050 --> 00:02:21,560
Just looking for death

40
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,560
Look like this

41
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,560
This group of trampling dogs

42
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,780
I have been shot by another hunter before and am afraid of the gun.
